{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28764","headline":"爲人题赠二首 一 · 杜牧","name":"爲人题赠二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我乏青云称，君无买笑金。\n虚传南国貌，争奈五陵心。\n桂席尘瑶佩，琼鑪烬水沈。\n凝魂空荐梦，低耳悔听琴。\n月落珠帘卷，春寒锦幕深。\n谁家楼上笛，何处月明砧？\n兰径飞蝴蝶，筠笼语翠襟。\n和簪抛凤髻，将泪入鸳衾。\n的的新添恨，迢迢绝好音。\n文园终病渴，休咏白头吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28764.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28764","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}